BT 1 0 0 1 0 24.7 Tm /F1 8.3 Tf 11 TL (We propose a web application that coordinates inventory, customer orders, warehouse fulfillment, and returns for an online retailer) Tj T* (operating three warehouses. The project will emphasize reliable transactions, concurrent inventory reservations, and measurable) Tj T* (query performance on a database containing at least one million order-item records.) Tj T* ET
