BT 1 0 0 1 0 35.7 Tm /F1 8.3 Tf 11 TL (The intended users are operations managers and warehouse employees at small to medium-sized online retailers whose inventory is) Tj T* (spread across several locations. Customers are a third user group: they need to place orders and follow fulfillment and return) Tj T* (progress. No business partnership or access to private retailer records has been secured; the initial application will model a) Tj T* (representative retailer.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
1 0 0 1 60 444 cm
q
0 0 0 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 35.7 Tm /F1 8.3 Tf 11 TL (For a retailer coordinating work through separate spreadsheets, order lists, and warehouse messages, available inventory can) Tj T* (become difficult to establish. An item may exist physically but already be reserved for another customer. Different employees may) Tj T* (promise the same stock, split shipments may be difficult to track, and canceled or returned items may be restored to inventory) Tj T* (incorrectly. Managers also need a consistent view of delayed orders and stock shortages across locations.) Tj T* ET
